Talent Protocol’s long-term vision includes expanding to multiple blockchains, including Ethereum and other EVM-compatible chains. The Prosperity Passport, built on Celo’s EVM-compatible infrastructure, provides a scalable foundation for Talent Protocol to experiment with SBT-based identity solutions before deploying them on other networks. This aligns with Talent Protocol’s marathon approach to building a decentralized professional network that is interoperable across Web3 ecosystems.

